  ******************************************************************************
  **                                                                          **
  **                        GW QUASIPARTICLE ENERGIES                         **
  **                                                                          **
  ******************************************************************************
   
   
  The GW quasiparticle energies are calculated according to: 
   
                      E_GW = E_SCF + Sigc(E_GW) + Sigx - vxc 
   
